\nSource Context:\nFluentCleaner is a free, open-source junk cleaner for Windows 10 and Windows 11 that quickly removes temporary files, browser caches, logs, thumbnails, and other unnecessary data. Built with a modern WinUI 3 interface, it delivers fast scans, smart cleanup, and a portable design without ads, subscriptions, or unnecessary registry cleaning.\n\nFluentCleaner comes in two flavors: the modern WinUI 3 edition with a sleek Windows 11-inspired interface, and FluentCleaner Classic\u2014a lightweight, 3.5 MB portable version with a familiar CCleaner-style layout. Choose Classic if you prefer maximum compatibility, instant startup, a tiny download, or need a cleaner that runs on virtually any Windows PC without additional runtime components.\n\nFluentCleaner key features:\n\n\n    Removes temporary files, caches, logs, and other junk files to free up disk space\n    Cleans browser cache, cookies, download cache, and browsing traces\n    Supports Windows 10 and Windows 11\n    Modern WinUI 3 interface with Fluent Design\n    Fast, real-time scanning with live progress updates\n    Displays recoverable disk space before cleaning\n    Organizes cleanup items into easy-to-manage categories\n    Uses the trusted Winapp2 database for extensive cleaning support\n    Removes Windows Update leftovers and thumbnail cache\n    Cleans temporary data from many third-party applications\n    Portable application that runs without installation\n    Command-line support for automated cleanup tasks\n    Preview scan results before deleting files\n    Optional extensions for additional functionality\n    Automatic update checking\n    No ads, subscriptions, or bundled software\n    Does not include risky registry cleaning\n    Open-source project with transparent development\n    Lightweight, fast, and easy to use\n    Designed with privacy and safe cleanup in mind\n\n\nFluentCleaner 26.08.03 changelog:\n\n\n    [Added] [Classic, Modern] Full Cookie Manager for managing and p