\nSource Context:\nGoogle Meet is a video calling application that stands out for its intuitive and simple design aimed at facilitating communication. Although it was developed for mobile devices, it offers a lot of features that make it extremely convenient for everyday calls and conference calls.\n\nEasy launch and integration with contacts\n\nUnlike many other chat services, Google Meet only requires phone numberto start using it. You don't need to create a special account or contact list - the app automatically uses the contacts from your phone. This makes it easy to connect with friends and family.\n\nGoogle Meet works like on Android phones as well as the iPhone. Upon installation, the app automatically takes the phone number from the SIM card and sends a confirmation SMS, making the process quick and hassle-free.\n\nInnovative features and connection quality\n\n\nKnock Knock: This Android-only feature is a real novelty. When you receive a call, it shows you live video of the person calling youeven before you picked up. The goal is to avoid annoying opening lines like \"Are you there?\" or \"Can you hear me?\". To avoid intruders, Knock Knock only works when a person in your contact list calls.\n\n\n\nAdaptive link quality: The application automatically lowers or raises the picture and sound quality depending on your connection speed. While talking, you can seamlessly switch from Wi-Fi to mobile data without worrying about the call dropping.\n\n\n\nSimple interface: The interface is extremely simple and won't bother you with unnecessary buttons and settings.\n\n\nGoogle Meet is a great solution for anyone looking for an easy-to-use and reliable video calling app on their mobile phone. License: Freeware.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOfficial pageDownload: Google Meet 374.0 for iOSDownload: Google Meet 374.0 for Android\n\nSOURCE_URL: unknown\n\nPHP_DETECTED_METADATA (Weak Hints):\n{\"software_name\":\"Google Meet\",\"version\":\"374.0\",\"homepage\":\"https:\\\/\\\/duo.g